  "steps": [
    "Steam the sweet potato for 20–25 mins until extremely soft, then mash until smooth.",
    "Soak dates in hot water until soft, drain and blend into a thick paste.",
    "Mix sweet potato, date paste and nut butter. Add protein powder, cocoa, oat flour, baking powder, vanilla and salt.",
    "Gradually add milk while mixing. The batter should be thick and fudgy but droppable from your spatula. It should NOT pour like pancake/cake batter. Adjust the sweetness if you wish with some zero calorie sweetner.",
    "Fold in some chocolate chips and transfer to a lined dish and top with remaining chocolate chips + walnuts (optional).",
    "⁠Pre-heat the airfryer at 160 for 5 mins.",
    "Air fry at 160°C for ~18-20 mins. A skewer should have moist crumbs, not wet batter. Don’t wait for it to come completely clean.",
    "Let it cool completely before slicing for the fudgiest texture. Cut into 8 squares."
  ],
